  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "時間"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>許愈琳</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>一、</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊無跤　m̄-koh真gâu走</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有時走kah ná龜leh sô</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有時走kah ná鳥leh飛</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī上課金金siòng ê烏枋頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī下課走sio掠ê運動埕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī愛人仔兩地相思ê眠床頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī愛人仔sann見約會ê電影院</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī等待花開ê時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī花開落塗ê時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī痛苦悲傷ê烏暗地</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī快樂心適ê遊樂園</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄管伊走tī啥mih所在</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">其實</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊ê跤步大細lóng sio-siāng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>二、</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">時間無跤　m̄-koh伊真gâu行</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過lán幼嬰仔臭奶呆學行ê路</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過lán幼稚園金金siòng ê tsit个世界</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過lán ǹg望khah緊大漢ê 17歲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過lán為家庭辛苦走tsông ê付出</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">時間真gâu行</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng無回頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一直行</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行過lán鹹酸苦tsiánn人生ê地圖</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQlA_jGrIg7Nkkm5CSKtSVCPNykqOWVGx6cUep6abF1wTxSTy01zED0_SkjnJJlaX6zI4Yh3N51Qx1owmGLcGplZyXJgKEwfUVjYyqcksLKUTQ1qwXNJB96b_wXQztwE9kdFrr5Q71HZT4YO869ESv0s1yR3FFGQznDajelgP0tzG8FAweOhufqxqg32W1/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1366%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQlA_jGrIg7Nkkm5CSKtSVCPNykqOWVGx6cUep6abF1wTxSTy01zED0_SkjnJJlaX6zI4Yh3N51Qx1owmGLcGplZyXJgKEwfUVjYyqcksLKUTQ1qwXNJB96b_wXQztwE9kdFrr5Q71HZT4YO869ESv0s1yR3FFGQznDajelgP0tzG8FAweOhufqxqg32W1/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1366%E6%9C%9F_6.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDO3GNqkvxT_vbBsnqnl7cDGrifdurgIOO85gebh02Vx6OrV-4jriiDG0Bil1WwGe3ti_MqrATu3mY_5ylHrPFTmaQrXUbQ1hjG23fNAKYgxXNbr0F94pKb4RLhNZcvF1EaukywPB9PeP9N2xgcFk0N7KX7PcDQWCU3ReJFwwBUr-4mwweryuPX3seCtG-/s1421/366%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDO3GNqkvxT_vbBsnqnl7cDGrifdurgIOO85gebh02Vx6OrV-4jriiDG0Bil1WwGe3ti_MqrATu3mY_5ylHrPFTmaQrXUbQ1hjG23fNAKYgxXNbr0F94pKb4RLhNZcvF1EaukywPB9PeP9N2xgcFk0N7KX7PcDQWCU3ReJFwwBUr-4mwweryuPX3seCtG-/w450-h640/366%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div c